## Six bounded repair families

- A player-built weighted seed press supplies the mechanism for expressing oil from visibly oil-bearing seeds. It is one useful construction, not a processing checklist or new stock grant.
- Formed clay and fired glazed bowls are distinct states. Existing firing supplies the liquid-holding vessel. The unsupported Bell → Dinner bell branch is removed rather than justified with an invented foundry mechanism.
- An oil-soaked fiber head and wooden support make the oil-wick torch; loose charcoal no longer masquerades as a torch construction.
- Clear glass and visible marks support relative collected-rain levels from the same vessel over equal intervals, not calibrated rainfall depth or volume.
- Basin grain images and spectrum supply their actual limited observations. The unrelated ice-photograph prerequisite is removed; the photograph remains a separately required return-archive record.
- The selection bridge preserves both inherited variation and resource limits. Differential reproductive outcomes remain a separate next premise.

These are the independently accepted local changes, not a declaration that every neighboring material or scientific abstraction is solved. Mounted-lamp identity remains unresolved and its recipes/branches are unchanged. Cooking-pot and formed-jar food-storage questions are not claimed as repairs. No physical-production, equipment-safety or performance certification is implied.

