## Validation limits

Complete focused suites, retained source contracts, optional-creature regressions, old-world equivalence, all-world routes, build/content checks and a single final intact aggregate are run serially. Final dated external receipts are authoritative for completed commands; this document does not pre-claim a pending check. Failed/interrupted records are retained rather than recast as passes.

Review was informed independent AI review, not a fresh blind human playtest. Source checks, engine replay, numeric bounds and synthetic DOM do not establish native iOS/Safari/touch, real-browser pixels, human comprehension or enjoyment. Existing narrower rendering evidence remains bounded to its tested versions. No universal blank-flash guarantee, new private screenshots, Clio/unto.me change or integrator GitHub/Sites publication is claimed.
